  -- `Good A`: a `C¹` family fixing `N` and `K = spt X` with `Dφ_t = I + t DA + o(t)` uniformly
  obtain ⟨Good, hGood⟩ : ∃ Good : (Euclid P → Euclid P) → Prop, ∀ A, Good A ↔
      ∃ φ : ℝ → Euclid P → Euclid P, ∃ C : ℝ, (∀ᶠ t in 𝓝 (0:ℝ), ContDiff ℝ 1 (φ t) ∧
